        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R6410, Victorian 4 Inch x 10 Inch Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Victorian 4 Inch x 10 Inch Register is a great choice for any home remodel. Its beautiful lines are only accentuated by the 5 finishes in which it is available. Choose from weathered black, venetian bronze, satin nickel, polished brass, or antique brass finishes. This 4 Inch x 10 Inch Victorian Register with Damper allows you to control the air flow to the room. It is easy to install in an existing or new 4 inch x 10 inch floor opening.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-12-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6412\"<b>4 Inch x 12 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-14-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6414\"<b>4 Inch x 14 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Victorian 4 Inch x 10 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
