                "title": "4 Inch x 10 Inch Victorian Register with Damper",
                "description": "The Victorian 4 Inch x 10 Inch Register is a great choice for any home remodel. Its beautiful lines are only accentuated by the 5 finishes in which it is available. Choose from weathered black, venetian bronze, satin nickel, polished brass, or antique brass finishes. This 4 Inch x 10 Inch Victorian Register with Damper allows you to control the air flow to the room. It is easy to install in an existing or new 4 inch x 10 inch floor opening.",
